#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:10
msgid "Chip information, integrity and entropy faces"
msgstr "芯片信息、完整性与熵接口"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:12
msgid ""
"Read chip identity and bounded integrity or entropy results through the "
"selected public face. A UID is not a secret, a CRC unit is not an arbitrary "
"hash, and source words alone do not establish cryptographic entropy quality."
msgstr "通过选定公共接口读取芯片身份及有界完整性或熵结果。UID 不是秘密，CRC 单元不是任意哈希，来源字本身不能证明密码学熵质量。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:16
msgid ""
"The entropy face supplies bounded, health-admitted source words. "
"`nx_entropy_fill` uses a finite absolute deadline and erases the complete "
"admitted output on a read failure. It does not allocate, create a worker or "
"establish entropy quality; it is not a DRBG. A source's existence does not "
"authorize full entropy credit for a cryptographic library. See the selected "
"{doc}`F407 owner </reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system>` for its typed factory,"
" Platform lifecycle and clock prerequisites. Other retained SDKs do not "
"grant an entropy provider."
msgstr ""
"熵源 face 提供通过健康检查、受长度界限约束的原始字。`nx_entropy_fill` 使用有限的绝对 "
"deadline，读取失败时清零全部已准入的输出。它不分配内存、不创建 worker，也不建立熵质量资格；它不是 "
"DRBG。熵源存在不授权密码库按完整熵量计入这些数据。所选 {doc}`F407 owner "
"</reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system>` 说明其 typed factory、Platform "
"生命周期与时钟前提。其他保留的 SDK 不授予熵源 provider。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:25
msgid "Sign an existing digest without exporting the key"
msgstr "签署已有摘要，不导出密钥"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:27
msgid ""
"`Nexus::IOP256Signer` exposes an existing selected signing-key face. The "
"caller supplies exactly 32 SHA256 digest bytes; the synchronous task-only "
"method returns raw P256 `R || S`, 64 bytes with each scalar big-endian. "
"Public-key output is 64-byte big-endian `X || Y`, without an `04` tag. No "
"implicit hashing, DER encoding, low-S normalization, certificate or "
"authorization policy is added."
msgstr ""
"`Nexus::IOP256Signer` 暴露已选签名密钥的既有 face。调用者提供恰好 32 字节的 SHA256 摘要；仅任务同步方法返回原始 "
"P256 `R || S`，共 64 字节，每个标量为大端。公钥输出是 64 字节大端 `X || Y`，不带 `04` 标记。不隐式增加哈希、DER "
"编码、low-S 规范化、证书或授权策略。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:33
msgid ""
"The face, operations and private context remain live through serialized "
"calls and joined provider stop. Inputs/outputs are disjoint from each other "
"and control storage. Every return releases MCU buffer access; failures leave"
" the complete public output unchanged. A finite provider-clock deadline does"
" not preempt device computation. Key identity, provisioning, physical "
"recovery and trust remain the product's responsibility. The selected "
"[ATECC608B adapter](../components/devices.md) verifies a specific already-"
"locked device/slot; its existence does not establish an opaque-key TLS "
"integration."
msgstr ""
"face、方法与私有 context 在串行调用和已会合的 provider stop "
"期间保持有效。输入／输出互相分离，也不覆盖控制存储。任何返回均结束 MCU 缓冲访问；失败保持完整公共输出不变。provider 时钟的有限 "
"deadline 不能抢占器件计算。密钥身份、provisioning、物理恢复与信任仍归产品。选定 [ATECC608B "
"adapter](../components/devices.md) 核验一组已经锁定的精确器件／slot；它的存在不建立 opaque-key TLS"
" 集成。"

