#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:46
msgid "Read the selected SoC's physical identity into independent storage."
msgstr "读取所选 SoC 的物理身份到独立存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:46
msgid ""
"Bounded privileged task/ISR read, including masked context. No clocks, "
"allocation, preparation or retained references. The selected Platform "
"supplies this symbol; CPU-only Runtime does not supply a SoC backend. UID is"
" public silicon identity, not authentication. The device/revision fields do "
"not prove an exact package or ordering code. Explicit Native test support "
"reports UNSUPPORTED without inventing physical identity."
msgstr ""
"有界的特权 task／ISR 读取，包含已屏蔽中断的上下文。不启用时钟，不分配存储，不需准备，也不保留引用。符号由所选 Platform 提供；CPU-"
"only Runtime 不提供 SoC 后端。UID 是公开的硅片身份，不提供认证证明。device／revision "
"字段不能证明精确封装或完整订货号。显式 Native 测试支撑返回 UNSUPPORTED，不编造物理身份。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:46
msgid "[out] Aligned caller-owned output; changed only on success."
msgstr "[out] 对齐且由调用方拥有的输出；仅在成功时修改。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:0
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:46
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, CONTEXT or UNSUPPORTED; no cached fallback values."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、CONTEXT 或 UNSUPPORTED；不使用缓存回退值。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:46
msgid "Copy opaque silicon identity bytes into caller-provided storage."
msgstr "将不透明芯片身份字节复制到调用者提供的存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:46
msgid ""
"Bounded privileged task/ISR read, no allocation, retained references or "
"initialization. Byte order is stable within the provider; consumers treat it"
" as opaque. The maintained STM32 provider emits each successive UID word "
"least-significant byte first. Identity is public and does not authenticate "
"the chip or prove a package/ordering code. Native models return UNSUPPORTED,"
" including size queries, rather than inventing UID."
msgstr ""
"有界的特权任务／ISR 读取，不分配、不保留引用、不初始化。字节序在同一 provider 内稳定，消费者将其视为不透明数据。维护的 STM32 "
"provider 按 UID 字顺序输出，每个字低有效字节优先。身份是公开信息，不认证芯片，也不证明封装或订货号。Native "
"模型对读取与大小查询均返回 UNSUPPORTED，不伪造 UID。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:46
msgid "[out] Writable bytes, or NULL with zero capacity to query size."
msgstr "[out] 可写字节存储；查询大小时使用 NULL 与零容量。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:46
msgid "[in] Complete caller-owned extent, not a platform maximum."
msgstr "[in] 调用者拥有的完整跨度，不是平台最大容量。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:46
msgid "[out] UID length on success; disjoint aligned writable storage."
msgstr "[out] 成功时的 UID 长度；独立、对齐且可写的存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:46
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID, OVERFLOW when capacity is insufficient, CONTEXT or "
"UNSUPPORTED. Both outputs remain unchanged on every failure."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、容量不足时的 OVERFLOW、CONTEXT 或 UNSUPPORTED。任何失败均保持两个输出不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:46
msgid "Native diagnostic profile: identity words, revision and Flash size."
msgstr "原生诊断 profile：身份字、revision 与 Flash 容量。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:46
msgid ""
"The maintained STM32 profile uses three UID words. Portable consumers use "
"nx_chip_uid_read rather than depending on this diagnostic layout."
msgstr "维护的 STM32 profile 使用三个 UID 字。可移植消费者使用 nx_chip_uid_read，不依赖该诊断布局。"

