#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "Direction does not change key/IV encoding or buffer ownership."
msgstr "运算方向不改变 key／IV 编码或缓冲区所有权。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "Query a selected algorithm without hardware effects or borrowing."
msgstr "查询选定算法，不产生硬件效果或借用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid ""
"Readonly, no allocation or implicit start. Query does not establish physical"
" qualification or approve product cryptographic policy."
msgstr "只读，不分配，也不隐式启动。查询不建立物理资格，也不批准产品的密码学策略。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "[in] Stable selected face and live private owner storage."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的选定接口，以及仍有效的私有所有者存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "[in] Standard algorithm selector."
msgstr "[in] 标准算法选择值。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "[out] Independent output, changed only on success."
msgstr "[out] 独立输出，仅在成功时改变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "SUCCESS, UNSUPPORTED, INVALID or provider error."
msgstr "SUCCESS、UNSUPPORTED、INVALID 或具体实现错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "Copy a valid value tuple into unborrowed request storage."
msgstr "将有效的值元组复制到未被借用的请求存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid ""
"Provider-specific alignment/granularity is checked at submit. Generic CTR "
"preparation does not require whole blocks. Partial input/output overlap is "
"invalid; exact in-place is subject to the provider query. Every referenced "
"byte span (input/output/key/IV) is disjoint from the entire mutable request."
" Output is also disjoint from key/IV. The operation argument itself is a "
"copied value, never a retained span. All spans are disjoint from opaque "
"provider state/config, proved by selected admission."
msgstr ""
"submit 检查具体实现要求的对齐与粒度。通用 CTR "
"准备不要求整块。输入／输出部分重叠无效；能否完全原位操作取决于具体实现的查询结果。每个引用的字节区间（input／output／key／IV）均须与整个可变请求分离。Output"
" 还须与 key／IV 分离。operation "
"参数本身只复制值，绝不是保留的数据区间。所有区间与不透明的具体实现状态／配置分离，由选定的准入路径证明。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "[inout] Initialized READY or consumed SETTLED descriptor."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的 READY 或已消费的 SETTLED 描述符。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "[in] Value copied here; it need not remain live afterward."
msgstr "[in] 值在此处复制；原对象此后无须继续有效。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "[in] Finite absolute Core monotonic deadline."
msgstr "[in] 有限的绝对 Core 单调 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE; rejection leaves the tuple unchanged."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID／STATE；拒绝时元组保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "Admit one operation; rejection has no retained or hardware effect."
msgstr "准入一个操作；拒绝时不保留引用，也不产生硬件效果。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "No queue, worker, allocation or concurrent control is supplied."
msgstr "不提供队列、worker、分配或并发控制。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "[in] Initialized privileged task owner, with IRQs unmasked."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的特权任务所有者，且 IRQ 未屏蔽。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "[inout] READY tuple and stable referenced spans."
msgstr "[inout] READY 元组及其引用的稳定区间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "SUCCESS means ACCEPTED, including later settled start failure."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED，包括之后结清的启动失败。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "Request cancellation without revoking any borrowed span."
msgstr "请求取消，不撤销任何已借用区间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "First terminal cause wins; hardware and secret cleanup still follow."
msgstr "最先确定的终止原因保持有效；仍须继续清理硬件与敏感状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "[in] Same serialized task owner as submit."
msgstr "[in] 与 submit 相同的串行任务所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "[inout] Exact active descriptor or observed SETTLED identity."
msgstr "[inout] 精确的活跃描述符，或已观察到 SETTLED 的身份。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "SUCCESS requests cancellation; STATE means another request."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示请求取消；STATE 表示属于另一个请求。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "Make bounded deadline/drain/cleanup progress without waiting."
msgstr "有界推进截止时间处理、排空与清理，不等待。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "HAL completion is a fact; it does not alone publish SETTLED."
msgstr "HAL 完成只是一个事实；它本身不发布 SETTLED。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "[in] Same unmasked task owner, called through stop/recovery."
msgstr "[in] 同一个未屏蔽 IRQ 的任务所有者；停机／恢复期间持续调用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "SUCCESS after progress; BUSY/IO can retain quarantined storage."
msgstr "推进后返回 SUCCESS；BUSY／IO 可能保留隔离中的存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "Close admission and drain the active operation and secret state."
msgstr "关闭新准入，并排空活跃操作及敏感状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid ""
"No task or notification destruction. Late IRQ cannot access retired "
"request/key/config storage after successful stop."
msgstr "不销毁任务或通知。成功停机后，迟到 IRQ 无法访问已归还的请求／key／配置存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "[in] Serialized owner; producers/observers must quiesce."
msgstr "[in] 串行所有者；生产者／观察者必须已停止活动。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "SUCCESS after complete withdrawal; BUSY/IO retains responsibility."
msgstr "完整撤回后返回 SUCCESS；BUSY／IO 保留责任。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "Bind an optional IRQ hint, independent of request state predicates."
msgstr "绑定可选 IRQ 提示，独立于请求状态判定条件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "Wake storage remains live through source/publisher withdrawal."
msgstr "在源和发布者撤回期间，wake 存储须持续有效。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "[in] Live serialized task owner, no active request."
msgstr "[in] 有效的串行任务所有者，且没有活跃请求。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "[in] Stable explicit hint binding, or NULL to detach."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且显式的提示绑定，或用 NULL 拆除绑定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "[in] Existing backend IRQ ceiling contract."
msgstr "[in] 既有后端的 IRQ 上限合同。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID／CONTEXT／STATE／BUSY／UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "Readonly transport constraints for one standard algorithm."
msgstr "一个标准算法的只读传输约束。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid ""
"A CTR provider can report length_multiple=1 or a whole-block value; CTR "
"itself does not imply a sixteen-byte request requirement."
msgstr "CTR 具体实现可以报告 length_multiple=1，也可以要求整块长度；CTR 本身不要求请求长度为十六字节的整数倍。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "Value copied at preparation; referenced storage is never copied."
msgstr "准备时复制值；绝不复制其引用的存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid ""
"key/iv contain standard algorithm byte order, not vendor words. bytes is "
"positive; output provides exactly bytes writable bytes. ECB has no IV; "
"CBC/CTR take a caller-selected IV/counter. No IV generation, padding, "
"authentication or secret-store policy is implied."
msgstr ""
"key／iv 使用标准算法的字节顺序，不使用厂商字。bytes 为正；output 须恰好提供 bytes 个可写字节。ECB 没有 "
"IV；CBC／CTR 接受调用者选定的 IV／计数器。不隐含 IV 生成、填充、认证或秘密存储策略。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "Caller-owned request; initialize base before the first prepare."
msgstr "调用者持有的请求；首次 prepare 前初始化 base。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid ""
"ACCEPTED retains this descriptor and input/output/key/IV through acquire-"
"observed SETTLED. Failed drain/secret cleanup retains them in QUARANTINED. "
"Original caller key/IV are never erased by this provider. transferred counts"
" bytes actually written in complete output blocks; a future byte-tail "
"provider counts only its actual tail bytes. Accepted failure can leave a "
"partial prefix. This is not authenticated output. Every terminal path first "
"withdraws peripheral/IRQ references and clears provider scratch, hardware "
"key/IV/context/FIFO residue and HAL pointer references, or proves the "
"documented exclusive reset. BUSY or refused cleanup keeps the borrow "
"QUARANTINED; not only stop cleans it."
msgstr ""
"ACCEPTED 保留本描述符及 input／output／key／IV，直到以 acquire 观察到 "
"SETTLED。排空或敏感状态清理失败时，它们继续保留在 QUARANTINED。具体实现绝不擦除调用者原始 key／IV。transferred "
"计数完整输出块中实际写入的字节；未来支持字节尾部的具体实现仅计数其实际尾字节。接受后发生失败可能留下部分前缀。这不是经过认证的输出。每条终止路径都先撤回外设／IRQ"
" 引用，并清理具体实现的临时数据、硬件 key／IV／context／FIFO 残留和 HAL 指针引用，或证明已完成文档规定的独占复位。BUSY "
"或清理被拒绝时，借用继续保持 QUARANTINED；清理不只发生在 stop。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "Immutable shared methods; one task serializes each controller."
msgstr "不可变共享方法；每个控制器由一个任务串行执行。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:52
msgid "Stable two-pointer face; factory lookup never initializes hardware."
msgstr "由两个指针组成的稳定接口；factory 查询绝不初始化硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:56
msgid "crc.h"
msgstr "crc.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:58
msgid "Serialized CRC-32 of an explicit sequence of 32-bit words."
msgstr "对明确的 32 位字序列执行串行 CRC-32 计算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:58
msgid "Compute fixed CRC-32 without byte-order or padding inference."
msgstr "计算固定 CRC-32，不推断字节顺序或补齐规则。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:58
msgid ""
"Polynomial is 0x04C11DB7, initial state 0xffffffff, no reflection and no "
"final XOR. An empty sequence returns the initial state. This is a word "
"sequence contract, not an arbitrary CRC or Ethernet byte stream. No "
"allocation, IRQ, DMA or retained references; inputs, output and face remain "
"stable through this synchronous call. A timeout discards the partial "
"calculation; each new call begins with a fresh initial state. Caller storage"
" is disjoint from provider state and hardware controls."
msgstr ""
"多项式为 0x04C11DB7，初始状态为 0xffffffff，不反射且无 final XOR。空序列返回初始状态。这是数值字序列合同，不是任意 "
"CRC 或 Ethernet 字节流接口。不分配存储，不使用 "
"IRQ／DMA，也不保留引用；输入、输出和接口在该同步调用期间保持稳定。超时丢弃部分计算；每次新调用从全新初始状态开始。调用方存储与 provider "
"state 和硬件控制区分离。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:58
msgid "[in] Initialized face with one serialized privileged task owner."
msgstr "[in] 具有单一串行特权 task owner 的已初始化接口。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:58
msgid ""
"[in] Aligned immutable 32-bit values, consumed MSB first. NULL is permitted "
"only for an empty sequence."
msgstr "[in] 对齐且不可变的 32 位数值，MSB 优先处理。仅空序列允许 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:58
msgid "[in] Number of words, not bytes; no implicit trailing padding."
msgstr "[in] 数值字的数量，不是字节数；不隐式补齐尾部。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:58
msgid "[in] Absolute live Core deadline, including final readback."
msgstr "[in] 当前 Core 时域的绝对 deadline，包含最终读回。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:58
msgid "[out] Independent aligned output, changed only on success."
msgstr "[out] 独立且对齐的输出，仅在成功时修改。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:58
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE, CONTEXT, TIMEOUT, IO or UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE、CONTEXT、TIMEOUT、IO 或 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:58
msgid "Shared immutable methods receive the selected controller context."
msgstr "共享的不可变方法接收所选 controller 的 context。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:58
msgid "Stable controller identity; lookup never resets the calculator."
msgstr "稳定的 controller 身份；查询不会 reset 计算器。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:62
msgid "entropy.h"
msgstr "entropy.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
msgid "Explicit entropy source and finite all-or-erased filling."
msgstr "显式熵源与有限的完整填充或全部擦除操作。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid "Typedefs"
msgstr "类型定义"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
msgid "Static two-pointer source face with private mutable state."
msgstr "含私有可变状态的静态双指针源接口。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
msgid ""
"Caller serializes use and lifecycle; face/table/state outlive each call. No "
"buffer or request is retained after return. Source enable, clock "
"dependencies, recovery and stop belong to its explicit lifecycle owner, not "
"to TLS or this face."
msgstr ""
"调用方串行化使用和生命周期；接口、方法表和状态必须存活至每次调用结束。返回后不保留缓冲区或请求。源启用、时钟依赖、恢复和停止由显式生命周期所有者负责，不由"
" TLS 或此接口负责。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
msgid "Try to copy one complete source word without waiting."
msgstr "尝试复制一个完整源数据字，不等待。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
msgid ""
"Invalid public spans reject before provider access. This wrapper cannot "
"infer the extent of an opaque context; the caller proves its complete "
"disjointness. Provider rejection never substitutes fixed values or "
"timestamps for entropy."
msgstr ""
"公共存储区间无效时，在访问 provider 前拒绝。此包装层无法推断不透明上下文的范围；调用方证明其完整区间互不重叠。provider "
"拒绝时绝不使用固定值或时间戳代替熵。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
msgid "[in] Live immutable face on its serialized task executor"
msgstr "[in] 在其串行任务执行器中使用的有效只读接口"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
msgid ""
"[out] Naturally aligned writable word, disjoint from face, table and the "
"complete private provider state"
msgstr "[out] 自然对齐的可写数据字，与接口、方法表及完整 provider 私有状态互不重叠"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY, IO, STATE, INVALID or UNSUPPORTED"
msgstr "SUCCESS、BUSY、IO、STATE、INVALID 或 UNSUPPORTED"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
msgid "Fill exactly the requested bytes before a finite deadline."
msgstr "在有限截止时间前恰好填满请求的字节。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
msgid ""
"Task-only synchronous polling; no heap, worker or OS wait. BUSY causes "
"another clock-bounded poll. The supplied clock must continue advancing "
"throughout the call; changing its domain or stopping its timer violates the "
"contract. NX_DEADLINE_NEVER is rejected. Complete words are emitted least-"
"significant byte first; unused final-word bytes are discarded. A zero-byte "
"request validates face and clock but performs no clock/source access and "
"accepts NULL output. Preflight rejection leaves output unchanged. Once "
"admitted, any error erases the complete output using volatile writes; no "
"partial entropy may be consumed. Output is disjoint from face/table/clock "
"and all their opaque live contexts. This function detects known-span "
"aliases, not opaque extents. Crypto libraries own conditioning, DRBGs and "
"trust policy."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文的同步轮询；无堆、工作线程或 OS 等待。BUSY "
"导致下一次受时钟约束的轮询。所提供时钟必须在整个调用期间持续推进；更换时间域或停止计时器违反合同。拒绝 "
"NX_DEADLINE_NEVER。完整数据字按最低有效字节在前输出；最后一个字中未用的字节被丢弃。零字节请求验证接口与时钟，但不访问时钟或源，并允许 "
"NULL 输出。准入前拒绝保持输出不变。准入后任何错误均通过 volatile "
"写擦除全部输出；不得消费部分熵。输出与接口、方法表、时钟及其全部有效不透明上下文互不重叠。本函数检测已知区间别名，不推断不透明对象的范围。调理、DRBG"
" 和信任策略由密码库负责。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
msgid "[in] Live serialized source; no concurrent lifecycle change"
msgstr "[in] 有效的串行化源；不得并发生命周期变更"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
msgid "[out] Writable byte span; NULL only for zero bytes"
msgstr "[out] 可写字节区间；仅零字节时允许 NULL"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
msgid "[in] Exact required output size, not an entropy estimate"
msgstr "[in] 所需输出的准确大小，不是熵含量估计"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
msgid "[in] Live monotonic microsecond clock in one stable domain"
msgstr "[in] 单一稳定时间域内有效的单调微秒时钟"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
msgid "[in] Finite absolute deadline in that clock domain"
msgstr "[in] 该时间域内的有限绝对截止时间"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only for a complete fill; TIMEOUT, IO, STATE or source error; "
"INVALID/UNSUPPORTED for preflight rejection"
msgstr "仅完整填充返回 SUCCESS；否则为 TIMEOUT、IO、STATE 或源错误；准入前拒绝返回 INVALID/UNSUPPORTED"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
msgid "Shared immutable entropy-source methods."
msgstr "共享的只读熵源方法。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:64
msgid ""
"try_read is task-only and bounded, never waits for hardware. SUCCESS copies "
"one complete health-admitted 32-bit word; BUSY means no word yet, IO means a"
" source/health failure, STATE means unavailable/closed. Failure leaves "
"output unchanged. The provider owns hardware health and initial sample "
"handling. No deterministic fallback, conditioning, DRBG or cryptographic "
"certification is implied."
msgstr ""
"try_read 仅限任务上下文且执行有界，从不等待硬件。SUCCESS 复制一个完整、通过健康检查的 32 位数据字；BUSY 表示尚无数据字，IO "
"表示源或健康检查失败，STATE 表示不可用或已关闭。失败保持输出不变。provider 负责硬件健康检查与首样本处理。不隐含确定性回退、调理、DRBG"
" 或密码学认证。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:68
msgid "hash.h"
msgstr "hash.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "Single-shot hardware digest/HMAC and retained byte spans."
msgstr "单次硬件摘要／HMAC 与保留的字节区间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "Exact standard operation; hardware availability remains explicit."
msgstr "精确的标准操作；硬件可用性始终显式声明。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "Query exact selected constraints with no hardware or borrow effect."
msgstr "查询选定的精确约束，不产生硬件效果或借用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "Readonly; no key policy, TLS binding or certification is implied."
msgstr "只读；不隐含密钥策略、TLS 绑定或认证资格。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "[in] Stable selected face and private owner storage."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的选定接口及私有所有者存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "[in] SHA1/MD5 or explicitly keyed variant."
msgstr "[in] SHA1／MD5，或显式带 key 的变体。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "Prepare a one-shot tuple without reading any message/key byte."
msgstr "准备单次元组，不读取任何消息／key 字节。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid ""
"Every referenced byte span (message/key/digest) is disjoint from the entire "
"mutable request. Digest is also disjoint from message/key; the operation "
"argument itself is a copied value, never a retained span. Provider-specific "
"limits reject before borrowing or hardware effects. No source padding or "
"full-message bounce buffer is required by this interface."
msgstr ""
"每个引用的字节区间（消息／key／摘要）均须与整个可变请求分离。摘要还须与消息／key 分离；operation "
"参数本身只复制值，绝不是保留的数据区间。具体实现的限制在借用或产生硬件效果前检查并拒绝。本接口不要求源数据填充，也不要求复制整条消息的中转缓冲区。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "[inout] Initialized READY or consumed SETTLED storage."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化为 READY 或已消费的 SETTLED 存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "[in] Value copied; its object is not retained."
msgstr "[in] 复制值，不保留该对象。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE, with no tuple mutation on rejection."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID／STATE；拒绝时不改变元组。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "Admit exactly one operation on an initialized serialized owner."
msgstr "在已初始化的串行所有者上准入恰好一个操作。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "Keep every span live through cancellation and verified cleanup."
msgstr "取消及经验证的清理期间，每个区间须持续有效。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "[in] Privileged unmasked task executor."
msgstr "[in] 特权且未屏蔽 IRQ 的任务执行者。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "[inout] READY descriptor and immutable input/key spans."
msgstr "[inout] READY 描述符与不可变 input／key 区间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "SUCCESS means ACCEPTED; rejection retains no reference/effect."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED；拒绝时不保留引用或效果。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "Cancel without revoking the active message/key/digest borrow."
msgstr "取消操作，不撤销活跃消息／key／摘要的借用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "First observed terminal cause wins; cleanup can outlive its deadline."
msgstr "最先观察到的终止原因保持有效；清理可以延续到截止时间之后。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "[in] Same serialized executor as submit."
msgstr "[in] 与 submit 相同的串行执行者。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "[inout] Active descriptor or observed SETTLED identity."
msgstr "[inout] 活跃描述符，或已观察到 SETTLED 的身份。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "Observe hardware/deadline and make bounded cleanup progress."
msgstr "观察硬件／截止时间并有界推进清理。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid ""
"No busy wait inside the HASH/RNG IRQ and no implicit worker. The bounded "
"FIFO provider requires explicit service while HMAC is active, including "
"between its inner/key phases. A wake is a hint; waiting only for a final "
"digest IRQ cannot advance those phases."
msgstr ""
"HASH／RNG IRQ 内没有忙等，也没有隐式 worker。有界 FIFO 具体实现在 HMAC 活跃期间要求显式 service，包括内部阶段与 "
"key 阶段之间。wake 只是提示；仅等待最终摘要 IRQ 无法推进这些阶段。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "[in] Same unmasked owner, called throughout stop/drain."
msgstr "[in] 同一个未屏蔽 IRQ 的所有者；停机／排空期间持续调用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "SUCCESS after progress; BUSY/IO may retain QUARANTINED storage."
msgstr "推进后返回 SUCCESS；BUSY／IO 可能保留 QUARANTINED 存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "Seal admission and retire hardware, key/context and IRQ references."
msgstr "封闭新准入，撤回硬件、key／context 及 IRQ 引用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "Callback completion alone cannot establish secret/context cleanup."
msgstr "仅回调完成不能证明敏感状态／context 已清理。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "[in] Serialized owner with producers/observers quiesced."
msgstr "[in] 串行所有者，生产者／观察者已停止活动。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "SUCCESS only after withdrawal; BUSY/IO retains responsibility."
msgstr "仅在撤回完成后返回 SUCCESS；BUSY／IO 保留责任。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "Attach one optional IRQ hint under the existing ceiling contract."
msgstr "按既有上限合同挂接一个可选 IRQ 提示。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "Retain wake storage until source and publishers have withdrawn."
msgstr "在源及发布者全部撤回前，保留 wake 存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "[in] Live owner with no active request."
msgstr "[in] 有效所有者，且没有活跃请求。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "[in] Stable explicit binding or NULL to detach."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且显式的绑定，或用 NULL 拆除绑定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "[in] Existing backend IRQ admission bound."
msgstr "[in] 既有后端的 IRQ 准入上限。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "Readonly algorithm/transport constraints, no hidden readable padding."
msgstr "只读算法／传输约束，不隐含额外可读填充。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid ""
"Alignment applies only to the named start address. A message/key with a "
"nonmultiple-of-four length never implies extra readable bytes. Positive "
"length multiples describe the selected transport, independently of "
"empty_message/empty_key. One accepts every byte length; a larger multiple "
"rejects other lengths before borrowing, without implicit pad."
msgstr ""
"对齐仅适用于所指明的起始地址。消息/密钥的长度不是四的倍数时，绝不意味着存在额外可读字节。正的长度倍数描述所选传输，与 "
"empty_message/empty_key 相互独立。倍数为一时接受任意字节长度；更大的倍数会在借用前拒绝其他长度，不添加隐式填充。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "Value tuple; referenced spans remain explicit caller storage."
msgstr "值元组；其引用的数据区间始终是调用者显式持有的存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid ""
"An empty input may use NULL. Plain hash requires NULL key/zero key bytes; "
"HMAC may use an empty key if the provider explicitly supports it. "
"digest_capacity is at least 20 bytes for SHA1 or 16 for MD5. Only the "
"algorithm's digest bytes are written; the remainder is untouched."
msgstr ""
"空输入可使用 NULL。普通 hash 要求 key 为 NULL 且 key 字节数为零；只有具体实现显式支持时，HMAC 才可使用空 "
"key。digest_capacity 至少为 SHA1 的 20 字节或 MD5 的 16 字节。只写入算法规定的摘要字节，其余部分保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "Caller-owned one-shot request and byte-span lifetime."
msgstr "调用者持有的单次请求及字节区间生命周期。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid ""
"ACCEPTED retains descriptor, message, key and digest until observed SETTLED."
" A failed hardware/context/secret cleanup retains the borrow in QUARANTINED."
" Caller key is never erased by this provider. Digest is valid only on "
"SUCCESS; failure may alter its contents. transferred is the digest byte "
"count on success and zero on error. Every terminal path withdraws "
"sources/IRQ references and clears provider scratch, key/context/FIFO residue"
" and HAL references, or proves the documented exclusive HASH reset. Refused "
"cleanup keeps the borrow QUARANTINED. Shared RNG source/IRQ ownership is "
"preserved."
msgstr ""
"ACCEPTED 保留描述符、消息、key 和摘要，直到观察到 SETTLED。硬件／context／敏感状态清理失败时，借用继续保留在 "
"QUARANTINED。具体实现绝不擦除调用者的 key。摘要仅在 SUCCESS 时有效；失败可能改变其内容。transferred "
"在成功时为摘要字节数，错误时为零。每条终止路径都撤回源／IRQ 引用，并清理具体实现的临时数据、key／context／FIFO 残留及 HAL "
"引用，或证明已完成文档规定的独占 HASH 复位。清理被拒绝时，借用继续保持 QUARANTINED。共享 RNG 的源／IRQ 所有权保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "Shared immutable operations; no queue, worker, heap or key store."
msgstr "共享不可变操作；没有队列、worker、堆或密钥存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:70
msgid "Stable two-pointer face; lookup does not initialize hardware."
msgstr "由两个指针组成的稳定接口；查询不初始化硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:74
msgid "p256_signer.h"
msgstr "p256_signer.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid "Finite SHA256 digest signing with a non-exported P256 key."
msgstr "用非导出的 P256 密钥有限签署 SHA256 摘要。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid "Existing initialized signer identity, without private key material."
msgstr "既有已初始化 signer 身份，不含私钥材料。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid ""
"Face/ops/context stay live through calls and joined provider stop. One task "
"executor serializes operations. No allocation or key discovery."
msgstr "face／ops／context 保持有效至调用和已会合的 provider stop 结束。一个任务执行者串行化操作。不分配或发现密钥。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid "Read the public key for the already selected signing key."
msgstr "读取已选签名密钥的公钥。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid ""
"Task-only synchronous settled call: no retained output after return. "
"Hardware identity/provisioning and authenticity need external policy. Output"
" cannot overlap face/ops or private provider control storage."
msgstr ""
"仅任务的同步 settled 调用：返回后不保留输出。硬件身份／provisioning 与真实性需要外部策略。输出不得覆盖 face／ops 或 "
"provider 私有控制存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid "[in] Stable readonly face and initialized private provider."
msgstr "[in] 稳定只读 face 与已初始化私有 provider。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid "[out] Distinct writable complete key, unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立可写完整公钥，失败不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid "[in] Finite absolute provider-monotonic deadline."
msgstr "[in] provider 单调域的有限绝对 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/STATE or actual provider error."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID／UNSUPPORTED／STATE 或实际 provider 错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid "Sign a caller-supplied digest without exposing private key bytes."
msgstr "签署调用者摘要，不暴露私钥字节。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid ""
"Synchronous settled buffers, including failure. No implicit hash, DER, low-S"
" normalization, certificate, authorization or private-key export. "
"Input/output are disjoint from each other and private control storage. A "
"deadline cannot preempt an already running device computation."
msgstr ""
"缓冲在包括失败的所有返回中同步结清。不隐式哈希、DER、low-S "
"规范化、证书、授权或导出私钥。输入／输出互相分离，也不覆盖私有控制存储。deadline 无法抢占已经开始的器件计算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid "[in] Stable same-executor selected face and provider state."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且同一执行者使用的选定 face 与 provider 状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid "[in] Complete immutable SHA256 digest, borrowed during call."
msgstr "[in] 完整不可变 SHA256 摘要，仅在调用中借用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid "[out] Disjoint complete raw R/S signature, unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立完整原始 R/S 签名，失败不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid "[in] Finite whole-operation absolute provider deadline."
msgstr "[in] 整个操作共用的有限绝对 provider deadline。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid "Exactly 32 SHA256 digest bytes, supplied and hashed by the caller."
msgstr "恰好 32 字节 SHA256 摘要，由调用者哈希并提供。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid "P256 uncompressed X then Y, each 32-byte big-endian, without 04 tag."
msgstr "P256 非压缩 X 后接 Y，每个为 32 字节大端，不含 04 标记。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid "ECDSA P256 R then S, each 32-byte big-endian; no ASN.1/DER framing."
msgstr "ECDSA P256 R 后接 S，每个为 32 字节大端；无 ASN.1／DER 封装。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:76
msgid "Shared readonly methods; each implements the public call contract."
msgstr "共享只读方法；每项实现对应公共调用合同。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:80
msgid "watchdog.h"
msgstr "watchdog.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid "Irreversible watchdog effects and neutral hardware reset causes."
msgstr "不可逆的看门狗效应与中立的硬件复位原因。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid ""
"Enable the selected watchdog and report its effect and known timing bounds; "
"activation is irreversible."
msgstr "启用所选看门狗，报告其效应及已知时间界限；激活不可逆。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid ""
"Success establishes nominal hardware programming, not a guaranteed deadline."
" Both timeout bounds remain zero when oscillator limits are unknown. A "
"product requiring bounded timing must admit the oscillator profile before "
"activation. Enable runs in a privileged task and is serialized with feed, "
"state and platform stop. Install IRQ feeding only after this call returns; "
"activation does not support a concurrent reload during shadow-register "
"programming. A window provider rejects timeouts that leave no admitted feed "
"window. Counter ticks and unknown prescaler phase do not establish an exact "
"wall-clock interval."
msgstr ""
"成功证明标称硬件编程已完成，不保证时限。振荡器界限未知时，两个超时界限均保持零。需要有界时序的产品必须在激活前准入振荡器配置。Enable "
"在特权任务中执行，并与 feed、state 和 platform stop 串行化。仅在本调用返回后才可安装 IRQ "
"喂狗；激活不支持在影子寄存器编程期间并发重载。 窗口 provider 会拒绝不能留下合法喂狗窗口的 timeout。计数器 tick "
"与未知预分频相位不能建立精确的实际时间间隔。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid "[inout] Fixed provider; product owns feed/recovery policy."
msgstr "[inout] 固定 provider；产品拥有喂狗和恢复策略。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid "[in] Requested nominal timeout in maintained range."
msgstr "[in] 所请求的标称超时，须处于已维护范围内。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid ""
"[in] Requested CPU-managed debug-freeze setting; external debugger "
"configuration is outside this request."
msgstr "[in] 请求由 CPU 管理的调试冻结设置；外部调试器配置不属于此请求。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid ""
"[out] Actual timeout bounds and remaining effect, including enabled=true "
"when later setup reports failure after enabling."
msgstr "[out] 实际超时界限及剩余副作用；若启用后后续配置失败，也包括 enabled=true。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid ""
"Success or INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED/IO; never claims enabled hardware was "
"disabled during rollback. Existing enable is identified. A provider without "
"CPU debug-control access rejects true with UNSUPPORTED before activation; it"
" neither queries nor changes external debugger control."
msgstr ""
"成功，或返回 INVALID/STATE/UNSUPPORTED/IO；绝不声称回滚禁用了已启用的硬件。已有启用状态会被识别。无法由 CPU "
"访问调试控制的提供者在激活前以 UNSUPPORTED 拒绝 true；它既不查询，也不改变外部调试器控制。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid "Feed an enabled watchdog without changing product health policy."
msgstr "对已启用的看门狗执行喂狗，不改变产品健康策略。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid "[inout] Fixed enabled provider with one serialized feed owner."
msgstr "[inout] 固定且已启用的 provider，只有一个串行化喂狗所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid ""
"Success, INVALID/CONTEXT, or STATE when no feed is admitted. A window "
"provider returns BUSY for an early feed and STATE for its guarded late "
"boundary; neither reloads or waits. Task/IRQ execution is bounded and "
"allocation-free."
msgstr ""
"成功；INVALID/CONTEXT，或未准入喂狗时的 STATE。窗口 provider 对过早喂狗返回 BUSY，对受保护的迟喂边界返回 "
"STATE；两者都不会 reload 或等待。任务／IRQ 执行有界且不分配内存。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid "Query current watchdog effect and timeout uncertainty."
msgstr "查询当前看门狗效果与超时不确定性。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid "[in] Fixed provider."
msgstr "[in] 固定 provider。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid "[out] Current hardware/remembered initialization state."
msgstr "[out] 当前硬件状态或已记忆的初始化状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid ""
"Success or INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE; UNSUPPORTED retains observed hardware "
"effects with both timeout bounds zero when those bounds cannot be "
"established. Never infer a disabled watchdog from a failed query or unknown "
"timeout."
msgstr ""
"成功或 INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE；无法建立时限界限时，UNSUPPORTED 仍保留已观察到的硬件效应，并把两个 timeout "
"界限保持为零。绝不能根据查询失败或未知 timeout 推断看门狗已经关闭。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid "Read latched boot reset causes captured before clearing flags."
msgstr "读取清除标志前捕获的锁存启动复位原因。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid "No implicit acknowledgement, reboot or product classification."
msgstr "不隐式确认、不重启，也不作产品分类。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid "Bitmask of NX_RESET_*; multiple causes may be reported."
msgstr "NX_RESET_* 位掩码；可同时报告多个原因。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid ""
"Hardware-selected timeout bounds, including declared clock uncertainty."
msgstr "硬件所选 timeout 界限，包含已声明的时钟不确定性。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid ""
"A zero minimum and maximum mean the timeout bounds are unknown, for example "
"while hardware shadow updates remain pending or no oscillator limits have "
"been reviewed. The enabled and irreversible facts remain valid. debug_freeze"
" reports the provider-supported firmware configuration. Providers with CPU-"
"readable debug control observe its setting. A provider without CPU debug-"
"control access supports false only; that value does not observe or describe "
"an external debugger's setting. An unproved activation write may retain "
"enabled and irreversible effects; the provider never retries it implicitly "
"or infers safe shutdown from failed readback."
msgstr ""
"最小值和最大值均为零表示超时边界未知，例如硬件影子寄存器更新尚未完成，或振荡器限制尚未复核。enabled 和 irreversible "
"事实仍然有效。debug_freeze 报告提供者支持的固件配置。能够由 CPU 读取调试控制的提供者会观察该设置。不具备 CPU "
"调试控制访问能力的提供者仅支持 false；该值既未观察，也不描述外部调试器的设置。 未证实的激活写入也可保留 enabled 与 "
"irreversible 效应；provider 不会隐式重试，也不会依据回读失败推断能够安全关闭。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid "Shared read-only methods using one provider state."
msgstr "使用同一个提供者状态的共享只读方法。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid ""
"Methods follow each public operation's ownership contract. Missing optional "
"methods report UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "各方法遵循对应公共操作的所有权合同。缺失的可选方法返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid "Immutable interface pointing to caller-owned state."
msgstr "指向调用者自有状态的不可变接口。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/io/system.md:82
msgid ""
"Face and state outlive callers, IRQs and retained borrows. Factory lookup "
"neither initializes nor acquires hardware."
msgstr "接口和状态的生命周期覆盖调用方、IRQ 及保留的借用。工厂查找既不初始化，也不取得硬件。"
